{"seq":3,"slug":"merchandising-attribution","title":"导购干预效果归因度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/global-effectiveness/merchandising-attribution","wordCount":2670,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"导购干预效果归因度量\">导购干预效果归因度量</h1><p>运营改了一条加权规则，三天后该类目 GMV 涨了 6%。这是规则的功劳，还是同期竞品缺货、还是自然季节因素？干预归因要回答的就是这个问题。它比普通的 AB 实验更难，因为干预是<strong>非随机的、常常全量生效的、且与业务节奏强相关</strong>——大促期间的干预与季节增长天然混杂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-归因要拆解的三层因果\">核心概念：归因要拆解的三层因果</h2><p>一个被干预过的商品，其指标变化可以拆成三部分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>intervention</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>干预净效果</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>trend</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>自然趋势/季节</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>confound</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>同期其他变化</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{total}} = \\underbrace{\\Delta_{\\text{intervention}}}_{\\text{干预净效果}} + \\underbrace{\\Delta_{\\text{trend}}}_{\\text{自然趋势/季节}} + \\underbrace{\\Delta_{\\text{confound}}}_{\\text{同期其他变化}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">干预净效果</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">intervention</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3813em;vertical-align:-1.698em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.477em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">自然趋势</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">季节</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trend</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.698em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">同期其他变化</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">confound</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>归因的目标是估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>intervention</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{intervention}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">intervention</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。三部分的识别难度递增：自然趋势可以用历史同期估计，同期其他变化（竞品、价格、供给）最难。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    T[指标变化] --&gt; A[干预净效果]&#10;    T --&gt; B[自然趋势]&#10;    T --&gt; C[混杂因素]&#10;    A --&gt; M1[实验法: 随机化]&#10;    A --&gt; M2[准实验: 匹配/断点]&#10;    A --&gt; M3[反事实: 模型预测]&#10;    B --&gt; M4[历史同期对照]&#10;    C --&gt; M5[协变量控制]&#10;    M1 --&gt; R[归因结论]&#10;    M2 --&gt; R&#10;    M3 --&gt; R&#10;    M4 --&gt; R&#10;    M5 --&gt; R\">graph TD\n    T[指标变化] --&gt; A[干预净效果]\n    T --&gt; B[自然趋势]\n    T --&gt; C[混杂因素]\n    A --&gt; M1[实验法: 随机化]\n    A --&gt; M2[准实验: 匹配/断点]\n    A --&gt; M3[反事实: 模型预测]\n    B --&gt; M4[历史同期对照]\n    C --&gt; M5[协变量控制]\n    M1 --&gt; R[归因结论]\n    M2 --&gt; R\n    M3 --&gt; R\n    M4 --&gt; R\n    M5 --&gt; R</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>随机化</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>在线 AB 实验</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>干预可以部分流量生效</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理位置实验</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>干预有市场差异</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断点回归</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有明确的强度阈值切分</td>\n<td>中强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双重差分（DID）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有可比的对照组与前后期</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合成对照</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有多个未受干预的相似单元</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反事实预测</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有充分的历史模型</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"首选方案-让干预可以随机化\">首选方案：让干预可以随机化</h2><p>最强的归因来自实验，而实验的前提是<strong>干预可以按流量部分生效</strong>。这要求在规则引擎的设计阶段就内置<strong>分流能力</strong>：一条规则可以有「生效比例 30%」的配置，这 30% 的流量看到干预后的排序，70% 看到基线。</p>\n<p>这个能力的设计有几个要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分流单位要匹配干预的粒度。</strong> 商品级干预（某商品加权）按用户分流即可；查询级干预（某查询的坑位）按请求分流更精确。分流单位选错会稀释效果——如果按用户分流但效果实际发生在查询粒度，同一用户在不同查询上看到不一致的结果，实验噪声变大。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性哈希。</strong> 同一用户在同一实验里必须稳定分到同一组，否则个性化信号与实验效果互相干扰。</li>\n<li><strong>干预指纹参与分流。</strong> 分流用的哈希键应包含干预规则集的版本指纹，这样规则修改后实验自动重新分流，避免旧流量被错误归入实验组。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把分流内置到规则引擎，是一个<strong>在设计阶段就决定归因能力</strong>的典型例子。如果规则引擎只支持「全量生效」，那么再强的统计方法也只能做观察性归因，结论强度天然弱一档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"位置偏差校正-干预度量最大的坑\">位置偏差校正：干预度量最大的坑</h2><p>干预的一个核心指标是「干预商品的点击率提升了多少」。这个指标有一个系统性偏差：<strong>干预通常把商品往前放，而更靠前的位置本身点击率就更高</strong>。如果不校正，任何「把商品前移」的干预都会被度量成正效果，哪怕是把一个不相关的商品前移。</p>\n<p>校正的标准方法是<strong>基于位置的点击率模型</strong>。设位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的期望点击率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，观测到的点击率是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CTR</mtext><mtext>obs</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CTR}_{\\text{obs}}(d, p) = \\theta_p \\cdot r_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CTR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是与位置无关的商品「真实吸引力」。要比较干预前后，必须把观测 CTR 除以位置因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，得到可比的无位置 CTR：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mtext>CTR</mtext><mtext>obs</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{r}_d = \\frac{\\text{CTR}_{\\text{obs}}(d, p)}{\\hat{\\theta}_p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.561em;vertical-align:-1.134em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1521em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CTR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.134em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\theta}_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.244em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计来自<strong>随机曝光</strong>——少量流量（比如 1%）上做随机打散排序，用随机曝光下的位置级 CTR 拟合。这个随机曝光量是「度量成本」，必须持续投入，而不是一次性标定（位置偏好会随时间与界面改版变化）。</p>\n<p>同样的偏差还影响<strong>坑位效果</strong>与<strong>广告 pCTR</strong>。三个场景的校正在数学上是一致的，实现上可以共用一套位置因子估计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双重差分与合成对照\">双重差分与合成对照</h2><p>当干预无法随机化（比如法务要求的全站屏蔽、或者大促的全球活动）时，需要用准实验方法。</p>\n<p><strong>双重差分（DID）</strong> 的设定是：找到一组「受干预」与一组「未受干预但趋势相似」的单元，比较两组在干预前后的变化之差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>DID</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>trt,post</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>trt,pre</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>ctl,post</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>ctl,pre</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\Delta}_{\\text{DID}} = \\big(\\bar{Y}_{\\text{trt,post}} - \\bar{Y}_{\\text{trt,pre}}\\big) - \\big(\\bar{Y}_{\\text{ctl,post}} - \\bar{Y}_{\\text{ctl,pre}}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DID</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trt,post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trt,pre</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ctl,post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ctl,pre</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>DID 的关键假设是<strong>平行趋势</strong>——如果没有干预，两组的变化趋势应该相同。这个假设必须被检验：用干预前的多期数据检查两组指标差是否稳定。如果干预前两组差异就在扩大，DID 的结论不可信。</p>\n<p>电商场景下，可行的对照单元包括：未受干预的相似类目、未受干预的相似市场、同一类目下未受干预的品牌。跨市场对照尤其有用，因为市场间的季节性往往不同步（南北半球、宗教节庆），这让平行趋势假设更可能成立——但反过来，市场间差异大又让可比性下降，需要权衡。</p>\n<p><strong>合成对照（synthetic control）</strong> 是 DID 的推广：不用单一对照组，而是用多个未受干预单元加权组合成一个「合成的」对照组，权重由干预前的拟合优度决定。它的优势是在对照组选择上更灵活，劣势是需要更多的单元与更长的历史数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分位与异质效果\">分位与异质效果</h2><p>平均效果（ATE）几乎总是掩盖重要的异质性。一个干预可能让头部查询 GMV 涨 5%、长尾查询跌 10%，平均下来是微涨——但长尾的恶化是真实问题。</p>\n<p>必须切分的维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>切分方式</th>\n<th>关注的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查询热度</td>\n<td>头部/腰部/长尾</td>\n<td>干预是否只对热门词有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类</td>\n<td>按一级类目</td>\n<td>是否有品类被误伤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场</td>\n<td>按站点</td>\n<td>跨市场效果是否一致（见 <a href=\"per-market-merchandising\">导购规则按市场差异化</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户生命周期</td>\n<td>新/早/成熟</td>\n<td>干预是否伤害新用户（见 <a href=\"../personalization/cold-start-personalization\">新用户/新市场冷启动</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置类型</td>\n<td>坑位/置顶/自然</td>\n<td>干预在不同位置上效果差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干预强度</td>\n<td>按乘子档位</td>\n<td>效果是否随强度递增（若否说明饱和）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中**「干预强度 vs 效果」**的切分特别有价值：如果 1.1 倍加权和 1.5 倍加权的效果差不多，说明效果来自「进入头部」这个阈值效应而非强度本身。这意味着运营不需要用大乘子，用小乘子即可达到效果并降低风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标口径-从曝光到长期价值\">指标口径：从曝光到长期价值</h2><p>干预的指标链条应该完整覆盖从曝光到长期价值，且每一层都要有明确定义。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>曝光</td>\n<td>干预商品曝光量、曝光位次分布</td>\n<td>位次分布必须记录，用于位置校正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互</td>\n<td>无位置校正点击率、加购率</td>\n<td>校正后的 CTR 才可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转化</td>\n<td>转化率、GMV、客单价</td>\n<td>注意归因窗口（点击后 N 天）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效率</td>\n<td>干预的边际收入（每单位位移带来的 GMV 增量）</td>\n<td>用于比较不同干预的性价比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期</td>\n<td>次会话回访率、类目覆盖度</td>\n<td>捕捉信任侵蚀与偏好收窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>相关性下降幅度、无结果率变化</td>\n<td>干预的代价侧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「边际收入」值得单独说：它是<strong>干预效果除以干预造成的位移量</strong>。一条把商品从第 20 位提到第 3 位的规则，如果带来的 GMV 增量与一条从第 5 位提到第 3 位的规则相同，那么前者的单位位移效率更高、更值得保留。用这个指标排序干预规则，能筛掉大量「食之无味」的低效规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因的可复现性-决策链与版本指纹\">归因的可复现性：决策链与版本指纹</h2><p>统计方法之外，归因还有一个工程前提：<strong>必须能重建当时的排序决策</strong>。如果三个月后要复盘一次大促，需要知道当时生效的规则集是什么。</p>\n<p>这依赖两个东西：干预版本指纹（见 <a href=\"../merchandising-rules/rule-conflict-resolution\">多规则冲突与优先级</a>）与决策来源链。做法是把每一次「干预版本上线」记录成一条事件：版本指纹、上线时间、生效市场、变更的规则列表。这条事件流与指标时间序列对齐后，就能把指标变化在时间轴上切分给不同的干预版本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    E[干预版本事件流] --&gt; A[时间轴对齐]&#10;    M[指标时间序列] --&gt; A&#10;    A --&gt; S[分段: 每个版本的生效窗口]&#10;    S --&gt; C1[段内: DID / 合成对照]&#10;    S --&gt; C2[跨段: 版本间对比]&#10;    C1 --&gt; R[归因报告]&#10;    C2 --&gt; R&#10;    R --&gt; O[决策: 保留/调整/回滚]\">flowchart TD\n    E[干预版本事件流] --&gt; A[时间轴对齐]\n    M[指标时间序列] --&gt; A\n    A --&gt; S[分段: 每个版本的生效窗口]\n    S --&gt; C1[段内: DID / 合成对照]\n    S --&gt; C2[跨段: 版本间对比]\n    C1 --&gt; R[归因报告]\n    C2 --&gt; R\n    R --&gt; O[决策: 保留/调整/回滚]</pre><p>图中「跨段对比」是一个低成本高价值的做法：相邻两个干预版本之间的效果差异，比「干预 vs 无干预」的对比更容易估计（因为时间更近、混杂因素更少）。用它做<strong>迭代式验证</strong>——每次只改一处，看相邻版本的差异，累积起来就能定位哪些规则真正有效。这也是 <a href=\"../merchandising-rules/pin-boost-bury-block\">置顶、加权、降权与屏蔽规则引擎</a> 里强调「干跑报告是回归基线」的原因：每次变更都是一个小实验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>指标变化可拆为干预净效果、自然趋势、混杂因素三层；识别难度递增，混杂因素最难。</li>\n<li>最强归因来自随机化，因此<strong>分流能力必须在规则引擎设计阶段内置</strong>（生效比例、一致性哈希、指纹参与分流）。</li>\n<li>干预前移商品的点击率提升必然含位置偏差，必须用随机曝光估计的位置因子校正；坑位与广告 pCTR 共用同一套校正。</li>\n<li>无法随机化时用 DID 或合成对照，DID 必须检验平行趋势；跨市场对照常用于电商，但要权衡季节性不同步与可比性下降。</li>\n<li>平均效果会掩盖异质性，必须按查询热度、品类、市场、用户生命周期、位置类型、干预强度切分；其中「强度 vs 效果」能识别阈值效应与饱和。</li>\n<li>指标链条要覆盖曝光、交互（校正后）、转化、效率、长期、成本；<strong>边际收入</strong>（效果除以位移量）是筛选低效干预的关键指标。</li>\n<li>归因的可复现性依赖干预版本事件流与决策来源链；相邻版本对比（迭代式验证）比「有 vs 无」更易估计，是低成本高价值的做法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"导购干预效果归因度量","id":"导购干预效果归因度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：归因要拆解的三层因果","id":"核心概念-归因要拆解的三层因果"},{"level":2,"text":"首选方案：让干预可以随机化","id":"首选方案-让干预可以随机化"},{"level":2,"text":"位置偏差校正：干预度量最大的坑","id":"位置偏差校正-干预度量最大的坑"},{"level":2,"text":"双重差分与合成对照","id":"双重差分与合成对照"},{"level":2,"text":"分位与异质效果","id":"分位与异质效果"},{"level":2,"text":"指标口径：从曝光到长期价值","id":"指标口径-从曝光到长期价值"},{"level":2,"text":"归因的可复现性：决策链与版本指纹","id":"归因的可复现性-决策链与版本指纹"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GMV 与相关性的平衡护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/global-effectiveness/revenue-relevance-balance"},"next":null}